<section class="px-hero" aria-labelledby="px-title" data-product-home="2"><div class="px-copy"><p class="px-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / Head &amp; Neck Optimization</p><h1 id="px-title">Ein freierer Nacken.<br>Ein klarerer Kopf.</h1><p class="px-lead">Erkunden Sie Kopfhaltung, Alltagserfahrungen und persönliche Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten.</p><p class="px-zero">Null ist nicht das Ziel.</p><div class="px-actions"><a class="px-primary" href="#px-roles">Möglichkeiten erkunden</a><a class="px-secondary" href="start/">Anliegen besprechen</a></div></div><div class="px-instrument"><p class="px-kicker">01 / Illustratives Modell</p><fieldset class="px-config"><legend>Kopforientierung</legend><input type="radio" name="px-orientation" id="px-left"><label for="px-left">Links</label><input type="radio" name="px-orientation" id="px-center" checked><label for="px-center">Mitte</label><input type="radio" name="px-orientation" id="px-right"><label for="px-right">Rechts</label><svg class="px-diagram" viewBox="0 0 400 340" role="img" aria-label="C0–C1"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".22"><circle cx="200" cy="154" r="130"/><circle cx="200" cy="154" r="108"/><path d="M200 15V318M32 210H368" stroke-dasharray="3 7"/></g><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" opacity=".7"><path d="M93 324Q127 275 167 260L181 212H219L233 260Q273 275 307 324"/><path d="M181 225h38m-41 13h44m-48 13h52m-57 13h62"/></g><g class="px-head" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M200 35C135 35 113 82 114 125L126 161Q140 181 169 193L182 210H218L231 193Q260 181 274 161L286 125C287 82 265 35 200 35Z"/><path d="M130 124Q154 106 181 124M219 124Q246 106 270 124M200 116V156L186 161M173 178Q200 188 227 178" opacity=".72"/><path d="M200 41V207M122 125H278" stroke-dasharray="4 5" opacity=".56"/></g><circle cx="200" cy="210" r="8" fill="var(--px-accent)"/><circle cx="200" cy="210" r="16" fill="none" stroke="var(--px-accent)"/><text x="223" y="207" fill="var(--px-accent)" font-size="12">C0–C1</text></svg></fieldset><p class="px-note">Schematische Darstellung, keine individuelle Messung oder Zielposition.</p><details><summary>Was zeigt das Modell?</summary><p>Eine Komponente der Kopforientierung relativ zum Hals.</p><a href="c0-c1/">C0–C1 ↗</a></details></div></section>
